abstract: >-
  Portable analysis code, processed figure-level source data, supplementary tables and
  reproducibility metadata for a cross-cohort transcriptomic study of a SLAMF8-marked
  scar-associated macrophage program linked to hepatic stellate-cell activation and fibrosis in MASLD.
